### Direct upload as PUBLIC (for an inline image):
###
### curl -b cookies.txt -X POST http://localhost:4000/api/uploads \
###   -F "file=@monimage.png;type=image/png" \
###   -F "visibility=PUBLIC"
### -> 201, "visibility": "PUBLIC" directly, viewable by
### anyone from the start, without going through a linking route.
###
### An absurd or missing value falls back to "PRIVATE" (default behaviour
### unchanged):
### curl -b cookies.txt -X POST http://localhost:4000/api/uploads \
###   -F "file=@monimage.png;type=image/png" -F "visibility=n'importe quoi"

