### ==========================================================
### ARTICLE VIEW TRACKING: foundation of behaviour tracking
### for recommendations (ArticleView). One view = 1 row per
### (user, article), never duplicated (upsert), and only
### for a logged-in user on a PUBLISHED article.
###
### No route exposes ArticleView (it is not meant to be read
### by the client): so we can only check the HTTP behaviour here
### (no error, unchanged status). To really check that a row is
### created / not duplicated / absent for an anonymous visitor,
### go through the database:
###
### docker compose -f platform/docker-compose.yml exec postgresql \
###   psql -U academic -d academic -c 'SELECT * FROM "ArticleView";'
### ==========================================================

### Create the author and their article
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "viewauthor@example.com",
  "name": "author",
  "password": "motdepasse123"
}

### @name viewArticle
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/articles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Vue test",
  "content": "contenu"
}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/articles/{{viewArticle.response.body.$.id}}/submit

### Create the reader (replaces the cookie), who will also review to publish the article
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "viewreader@example.com",
  "name": "reader",
  "password": "motdepasse123"
}

### @name viewReview
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/articles/{{viewArticle.response.body.$.id}}/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/reviews/{{viewReview.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "APPROVED"
}

### The reader views the published article (200 expected, one view recorded in the database)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/articles/{{viewArticle.response.body.$.id}}

### Reloaded twice: still 200, but no new row in the database (upsert)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/articles/{{viewArticle.response.body.$.id}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/articles/{{viewArticle.response.body.$.id}}

### Anonymous views the same article (200 expected, but no view recorded - no session)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/articles/{{viewArticle.response.body.$.id}}
